---
import ExampleSection from "../../ExampleSection.astro";
import ExampleCodeBlock from "../../ExampleCodeBlock.astro";
import CodeSnippet from "../../CodeSnippet.astro";
---

<ExampleSection id="meeting-slot" eyebrow="Interaction modes" title="Meeting duration slot" status="partial">
    <Fragment slot="description">
        A one-hour meeting on a workday calendar. Drag the block to a free slot without changing
        its length, or press anywhere on the day to send it there; the handles still resize. Busy
        times are shown behind the track.
        <code>interaction="range"</code> is a working name pending bikeshed on
        <a href="https://github.com/openui/open-ui/issues/1460">#1460</a>.
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="disclosure">
        The separate <code>RangeGroupSegmentDragging</code> runtime flag enables the working pointer behavior. Scheduling
        adds a product-specific question beyond generic segment dragging: should movement stop at unavailable times, skip
        across them, or remain valid while the application reports a conflict? This prototype keeps availability and conflict
        policy author-owned. A public interval interaction still needs an explicit hit area plus keyboard and accessibility
        equivalents.
    </Fragment>
    <div slot="demo" class="meeting-slot-card">
        <style is:global>
            .meeting-slot-card {
                --ms-free: #14b8a6;
                --ms-busy: #f59e0b;
                --ms-conflict: #ef4444;
                --ms-busy-fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ms-busy) 28%, var(--surface));
            }
            .meeting-slot-stage {
                position: relative;
                padding-top: 2.5rem;
            }
            .meeting-slot-busy {
                position: absolute;
                top: 0;
                height: 1.35rem;
                border-radius: 4px;
                background: var(--ms-busy-fill);
                border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--ms-busy) 45%, var(--border));
                color: var(--text-strong);
                font-size: 0.68rem;
                font-weight: 700;
                letter-spacing: 0.02em;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                padding: 0 0.35rem;
                overflow: hidden;
                white-space: nowrap;
                pointer-events: none;
                z-index: 1;
            }
            .meeting-slot-busy-standup {
                left: 10%;
                width: 5%;
            }
            .meeting-slot-busy-review {
                left: 50%;
                width: 10%;
            }
            #meeting-slot-range {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 2;
            }
            #meeting-slot-range::slider-segment(2) {
                background: var(--ms-free);
                cursor: grab;
            }
            #meeting-slot-range.is-conflict::slider-segment(2) {
                background: var(--ms-conflict);
            }
            .meeting-slot-ticks {
                position: relative;
                z-index: 3;
                height: 4px;
                margin-top: -7px;
                color: var(--text-soft);
                background: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, currentColor 0 1px, transparent 1px 5%);
                pointer-events: none;
            }
            .meeting-slot-ticks::after {
                content: "";
                position: absolute;
                inset-block: 0;
                inset-inline-end: 0;
                width: 1px;
                background: currentColor;
            }
            .meeting-slot-scale {
                position: relative;
                height: 1.25rem;
                margin-top: 0.35rem;
                color: var(--text-muted);
                font-size: 0.72rem;
                line-height: 1;
            }
            .meeting-slot-scale span {
                position: absolute;
                inset-inline-start: var(--meeting-position);
                translate: -50% 0;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .meeting-slot-scale span:first-child {
                translate: 0 0;
            }
            .meeting-slot-scale span:last-child {
                translate: -100% 0;
            }
            .meeting-slot-readout {
                margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
                color: var(--text-muted);
            }
            .meeting-slot-readout[data-conflict="true"] {
                color: var(--ms-conflict);
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            @media (max-width: 700px) {
                .meeting-slot-busy {
                    font-size: 0;
                }
            }
        </style>
        <div class="meeting-slot-stage">
            <div
                class="meeting-slot-busy meeting-slot-busy-standup"
                role="img"
                aria-label="Standup, 9:00–9:30 AM"
            >
                Standup
            </div>
            <div
                class="meeting-slot-busy meeting-slot-busy-review"
                role="img"
                aria-label="Design review, 1:00–2:00 PM"
            >
                Design review
            </div>
            <rangegroup id="meeting-slot-range" min="480" max="1080" list="meeting-ticks" stepbetween="30">
                <legend class="visually-hidden">Meeting time</legend>
                <label class="visually-hidden">
                    Start
                    <input type="range" name="meeting-start" min="480" max="1080" value="600" />
                </label>
                <label class="visually-hidden">
                    End
                    <input type="range" name="meeting-end" min="480" max="1080" value="660" />
                </label>
            </rangegroup>
            <div class="meeting-slot-ticks" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="meeting-slot-scale" aria-hidden="true">
                <span style="--meeting-position: 0%">8 AM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 10%">9 AM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 20%">10 AM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 30%">11 AM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 40%">12 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 50%">1 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 60%">2 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 70%">3 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 80%">4 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 90%">5 PM</span>
                <span style="--meeting-position: 100%">6 PM</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <datalist id="meeting-ticks">
            <option value="480" label="8 AM"></option>
            <option value="510"></option>
            <option value="540" label="9 AM"></option>
            <option value="570"></option>
            <option value="600" label="10 AM"></option>
            <option value="630"></option>
            <option value="660" label="11 AM"></option>
            <option value="690"></option>
            <option value="720" label="12 PM"></option>
            <option value="750"></option>
            <option value="780" label="1 PM"></option>
            <option value="810"></option>
            <option value="840" label="2 PM"></option>
            <option value="870"></option>
            <option value="900" label="3 PM"></option>
            <option value="930"></option>
            <option value="960" label="4 PM"></option>
            <option value="990"></option>
            <option value="1020" label="5 PM"></option>
            <option value="1050"></option>
            <option value="1080" label="6 PM"></option>
        </datalist>
        <p class="meeting-slot-readout" id="meeting-slot-readout" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <ExampleCodeBlock slot="code">
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="html"
            code={`
<rangegroup min="480" max="1080" list="meeting-ticks" stepbetween="30">
  <!-- The RangeGroupSegmentDragging flag enables interior segment dragging.
       Calendar availability and conflict policy remain author-owned. -->
  <legend>Meeting time</legend>
  <label>Start <input type="range" name="meeting-start" min="480" max="1080" value="600"></label>
  <label>End   <input type="range" name="meeting-end" min="480" max="1080" value="660"></label>
</rangegroup>
<div class="meeting-slot-ticks" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="meeting-slot-scale" aria-hidden="true">
  <span style="--meeting-position: 0%">8 AM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 10%">9 AM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 20%">10 AM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 30%">11 AM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 40%">12 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 50%">1 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 60%">2 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 70%">3 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 80%">4 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 90%">5 PM</span>
  <span style="--meeting-position: 100%">6 PM</span>
</div>
`}
        />
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="css"
            code={`
.meeting-slot-card {
  --ms-free: #14b8a6;
  --ms-busy: #f59e0b;
  --ms-conflict: #ef4444;
}
.meeting-slot-busy {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  height: 1.35rem;
  background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--ms-busy) 28%, var(--surface));
  border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--ms-busy) 45%, var(--border));
}
.meeting-slot-busy-standup { left: 10%; width: 5%; }
.meeting-slot-busy-review { left: 50%; width: 10%; }
rangegroup::slider-segment(2) {
  background: var(--ms-free);
  cursor: grab;
}
rangegroup.is-conflict::slider-segment(2) {
  background: var(--ms-conflict);
}
.meeting-slot-ticks {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 3;
  height: 4px;
  margin-top: -7px;
  color: var(--text-soft);
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    to right,
    currentColor 0 1px,
    transparent 1px 5%
  );
  pointer-events: none;
}
.meeting-slot-ticks::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset-block: 0;
  inset-inline-end: 0;
  width: 1px;
  background: currentColor;
}
.meeting-slot-scale {
  position: relative;
  height: 1.25rem;
  margin-top: .35rem;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: .72rem;
  line-height: 1;
}
.meeting-slot-scale span {
  position: absolute;
  inset-inline-start: var(--meeting-position);
  translate: -50% 0;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.meeting-slot-scale span:first-child { translate: 0 0; }
.meeting-slot-scale span:last-child { translate: -100% 0; }
.meeting-slot-readout[data-conflict="true"] {
  color: var(--ms-conflict);
  font-weight: 600;
}
`}
        />
        <CodeSnippet
            lang="javascript"
            code={`
const busy = [
  { start: 540, end: 570, label: "Standup" },
  { start: 780, end: 840, label: "Design review" },
];
const rg = document.querySelector("#meeting-slot-range");
const readout = document.querySelector("#meeting-slot-readout");
const format = (minutes) => {
  const hour = Math.floor(minutes / 60);
  return \`\${hour % 12 || 12}:\${String(minutes % 60).padStart(2, "0")} \${hour >= 12 ? "PM" : "AM"}\`;
};

// Visual conflict styling can track input; the status readout speaks on change
// so assistive tech is not flooded mid-drag.
rg.addEventListener("input", () => {
  const [a, b] = rg.values;
  rg.classList.toggle(
    "is-conflict",
    busy.some((block) => Math.max(a, block.start) < Math.min(b, block.end))
  );
});
rg.addEventListener("change", () => {
  const [a, b] = rg.values;
  const hit = busy.find((block) => Math.max(a, block.start) < Math.min(b, block.end));
  readout.textContent = hit
    ? \`\${format(a)} – \${format(b)} · Conflicts with \${hit.label}\`
    : \`\${format(a)} – \${format(b)} · 1h · Free slot\`;
});
`}
        />
    </ExampleCodeBlock>
    <script is:inline slot="runtime">
        (() => {
            const init = () => {
                const rg = document.querySelector("#meeting-slot-range");
                const readout = document.querySelector("#meeting-slot-readout");
                if (!rg || !readout) return;

                const minutesToTime = (m) => {
                    const h = Math.floor(m / 60);
                    const ampm = h >= 12 ? "PM" : "AM";
                    const displayH = h % 12 === 0 ? 12 : h % 12;
                    return `${displayH}:${String(m % 60).padStart(2, "0")} ${ampm}`;
                };
                const minutesToDuration = (mins) => {
                    const h = Math.floor(mins / 60);
                    const rest = mins % 60;
                    if (h === 0) return `${rest}m`;
                    if (rest === 0) return `${h}h`;
                    return `${h}h ${rest}m`;
                };

                const busy = [
                    { start: 540, end: 570, label: "Standup" },
                    { start: 780, end: 840, label: "Design review" },
                ];

                rg.valueTextFormatter = minutesToTime;

                const syncVisual = () => {
                    const [a, b] = rg.values;
                    const hit = busy.find((block) => Math.max(a, block.start) < Math.min(b, block.end));
                    if (hit) {
                        rg.classList.add("is-conflict");
                        readout.dataset.conflict = "true";
                    } else {
                        rg.classList.remove("is-conflict");
                        readout.dataset.conflict = "false";
                    }
                };

                const syncReadout = () => {
                    const [a, b] = rg.values;
                    const hit = busy.find((block) => Math.max(a, block.start) < Math.min(b, block.end));
                    const duration = minutesToDuration(b - a);
                    if (hit) {
                        readout.textContent = `${minutesToTime(a)} – ${minutesToTime(b)} · ${duration} · Conflicts with ${hit.label}`;
                    } else {
                        readout.textContent = `${minutesToTime(a)} – ${minutesToTime(b)} · ${duration} · Free slot`;
                    }
                    syncVisual();
                };

                // Conflict colour tracks every input event; the status readout
                // announces only when the interaction commits.
                rg.addEventListener("input", syncVisual);
                rg.addEventListener("change", syncReadout);
                syncReadout();
            };

            if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", init, { once: true });
            } else {
                init();
            }
        })();
    </script>
</ExampleSection>
